         <ab xml:space="preserve">
         <lb edRef="inst:5293" n="28b3"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex087042026-02-2316-14-48" status="finalized"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:4018">chu mig pa</rs> <expan>phyogs chos</expan> grub cing bsgrub bya'i chos sgras <choice><sic>khyar</sic><corr>khyad</corr></choice> par du byas pa dang rjes su 'gro ldog nges pa zhes 'dod pa la | sgra mi rtag bsgrub kyi ltos <expan>dag gi</expan> rtags thams cad der thal | bsgrub bya'i chos sgras khyad par du byas pa dang rjes su ldog nges pa'i phyir te |</seg></ab>
