         <ab xml:space="preserve"><gap reason="omitted"/><lb edRef="inst:5293" n="33a7"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex087042026-02-2316-46-34" status="finalized"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:4006">ral gri</rs> dus mnyam rgyu <expan>'bras su</expan> 'dod pa dang brgyud rgyus rgyu'i go mi chod par 'dod pa ni | <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:3773">chos grags</rs> kyi gzhung rnam × s dang 'gal ba yin no ||</seg></ab>
