         <lb edRef="inst:5293" n="33b6"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex087042026-02-2315-44-51" status="finalized"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:7785">dz+nya na shri mi tri</rs> na re |
         <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:7786">rgyu dang 'bras bu'i <expan>dngos po</expan></rs> ni || 
        
         <quote><lg> <l><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference" ref="db:4593">kha <lb edRef="inst:5293" n="33b7"/> 1</rs> rnam pa lnga yis smra || </l><l><expan>mngon sum</expan> dang ni mi dmigs pa'i ||</l>
         <l>dbye ba 3 gyis yang dag 'grub ||</l></lg></quote>
         ces phrugs 3 du bzhed de |
         <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference" ref="db:7785">khong</rs> gis mdzad pa'i <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:7786">rgyu dang <expan>'bras bu'i</expan> <expan>dngos po</expan> grub po</rs> las ||
         <quote><lg><l>gal te snga ma'i mi <expan>dmigs</expan> pas ||</l>
         <l>gzhan dang 'brel ba <expan>la sogs</expan> pa ||</l>
         <l>gcod pa med na de ci zhig</l> |
         <l><expan>gcad de</expan> na phyi mas ci zhig <lb edRef="inst:5293" n="34a1"/> bya</l></lg></quote> zhes bshad de || <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:3892">chos rje sa skya pa</rs> yang de'i lugs dang mthun par phrugs 3 du bzhed do ||</seg>
      </ab>
