         <ab xml:space="preserve"><gap reason="omitted"/><lb edRef="inst:5293" n="34a6"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex087042026-02-2317-05-14" status="finalized"><rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:5564">rig pa'i gter</rs> du 'gal 'brel gzhi' mthun pa mi srid cing dngos po tha dad phan gnod byed na 'gal 'brel dang | de lta ma yin mi 'gal ma 'brel ba'i tha dad tsam du bzhed pa ltar na <note type="editorial">This corresponds to Chu mig pa's definitions in the rNam rgyal</note> | gnod byed tsha reg gis <lb edRef="inst:5293" n="34a7"/> nus chung du byas pa'i gnod bya grang reg nus chung <expan>chos can</expan> ¦ gnod byed tsha reg dang ma 'brel par thal 'gal ba'i phyir ro ||</seg></ab>
