         <ab xml:space="preserve"><gap reason="omitted"/><lb edRef="inst:5293" n="36b5"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex087042026-02-2315-48-02" status="finalized"><rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:5564">rigs gter</rs> las khyab byed 'gal <expan>dmigs</expan> su bshad pa ni ltos pa'i khyab byed ma nges pa dang dngos 'gal nges pa <expan>dmigs</expan> pa'i sgo nas dang || nges pa'i khyab byed mi ltos pa dang dngos 'gal ltos <lb edRef="inst:5293" n="36b6"/> pa <expan>dmigs</expan> pa'i sgo nas yin mod | 'on kyang 'gal khyab <expan>dmigs</expan> pa 'dir sdud pa rnam pa gsal ba <expan>yin no</expan> ||</seg>
      </ab>
